{
  "_about": [
    "The French interior of Coffee and Toe Beans: Haussmann moldings, a marble bistro table, brass lamps.",
    "The picture is 104 x 84 pixels (104 x 42 terminal cells); x goes right from 0, y goes down from 0.",
    "rect is [x, y, width, height]. Colours are names from 'colors' below, or #rrggbb.",
    "Elements are painted in order, back to front. 'note' is just a label for you.",
    "lights: lamps and the candle. radius is how far their glow reaches, in pixels.",
    "cup: stand is where your drink stands on the table (the bottom-left pixel of the cup).",
    "cat_spots: places cats can be. at: the pixel under the middle of the cat, where it sits or lies.",
    "  behind: the id of the first element that stays in front of a cat there (here the table and everything on it).",
    "  flip: cats there face the other way (so a tail doesn't run off the edge). poses: the poses that fit there.",
    "  near: how close it is to your seat (0 far, 1 nearby, 2 right at your table); cats come closer as they get to know you.",
    "  place: where you look to see it (window, cats or table), for the ← → label and the cats' moments.",
    "id: a name for an element, so cat spots can refer to it."
  ],
